summary:
  The bitrate fallback plays without asking whether the order lapsed.

history:
  The upgraded address errs on waking and 600 ms later the original one
  plays, hours after anyone last heard it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
              if (!fallbackUrl || root._tsPaused || _orderLapsed()) { fallbackUrl = ""; return; }

replace:
              if (!fallbackUrl || root._tsPaused) { fallbackUrl = ""; return; }

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_every_automatic_road_to_sound_asks_whether_the_order_lapsed.
  Line-neutral.
